        McqQuestion(id: "sci6_c048_q4", text: "Which animal gives birth to live young (instead of laying eggs)?", options: ["Hen", "Frog", "Dog", "Butterfly"], correctIndex: 2, explanation: "Dogs (mammals) give birth to live young — most other listed animals lay eggs."),
        McqQuestion(id: "sci6_c048_q5", text: "Metamorphosis means:", options: ["Migration to warmer places", "A dramatic change in body form during the life cycle", "The growth of new leaves", "The mating of two animals"], correctIndex: 1, explanation: "Metamorphosis is the remarkable transformation in form during development — seen in butterflies, frogs and many insects.")
