        McqQuestion(id: "sci7_c011_q4", text: "Galvanisation is coating iron with which metal to prevent rusting?", options: ["Copper", "Zinc", "Gold", "Silver"], correctIndex: 1, explanation: "Galvanisation applies a thin zinc coating — zinc acts as a sacrificial metal, protecting the iron underneath."),
